    <briefdescription>
<para>Registry of SVG graphics assets — 10 keys. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Nested inside <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_theme" kindref="compound">Theme</ref>. CRTP-derived from <ref refid="classjam_1_1Map_1_1Instance" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Map::Instance&lt;Graphics&gt;</ref>.</para>
<para>Maps each enum key to its Identifier stem and resolves the on-disk filename via <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_theme_1_1_graphics_1a841d315bcce8e447158a9458f13c003d" kindref="member">getName()</ref>. All keys produce &quot;stem.svg&quot;.</para>
<para>No static path — graphics directory resolved at call site: Theme::getPath(name).getChildFile(jam::IDref::graphics).</para>
<para>The live instance is owned by <ref refid="classend_1_1_application" kindref="compound">end::Application</ref> via <ref refid="structend_1_1_map" kindref="compound">end::Map</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
